{"term": {"label": "愛", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」", "occurrences": 6, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "兼", "id": "兼"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "口", "id": "口"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "大人", "id": "大人"}, {"form": "天爵", "id": "天爵"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "小人", "id": "小人"}, {"form": "尺寸", "id": "尺寸"}, {"form": "弟", "id": "弟"}, {"form": "愛", "variants": [], "id": "愛"}, {"form": "指", "id": "指"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "膚", "id": "膚"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}, {"form": "鄉", "id": "郷"}, {"form": "飲食", "id": "飲食"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.7296870405856775, "source": "養", "target": "失"}, {"weight": 1.3242219324775129, "source": "養", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 2.4228342211456226, "source": "養", "target": "兼"}, {"weight": 1.3242219324775129, "source": "養", "target": "愛"}, {"weight": 2.017369113037458, "source": "養", "target": "尺寸"}, {"weight": 2.017369113037458, "source": "養", "target": "膚"}, {"weight": 2.199690669831413, "source": "養", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 2.4228342211456226, "source": "養", "target": "小人"}, {"weight": 1.5065434892714675, "source": "養", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.4228342211456226, "source": "養", "target": "大人"}, {"weight": 2.017369113037458, "source": "養", "target": "指"}, {"weight": 3.0106208860477417, "source": "小人", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.079099474444528, "source": "郷", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.7296870405856775, "source": "郷", "target": "敬"}, {"weight